                        </div>
                        <p class="text-slate-300">Found in: <em>Collection#1 (2019), Canva Data Leak (2019), Marketing Dumps (2022)</em>.</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-cyber-warning">Recommendation: Immediately change passwords for associated online services!</p>
                    `;
                } else {
                    resBox.className = "p-4 rounded-xl border bg-cyber-success/10 border-cyber-success/40 text-cyber-success text-xs space-y-2";
